#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_groups.rst:17
msgid "Networks"
msgstr "Redes"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_groups.rst:17
msgid "Search for and select target Networks for the Network Group"
msgstr "Search para y seleccionar destino Redes para el Grupo de red"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_groups.rst:18
msgid "Search for and select target Subnets for the Network Group"
msgstr "Search para y seleccionar destino Subredes para el Grupo de red"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_groups.rst:19
msgid "Group Access"
msgstr "Group Access"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_groups.rst:20
msgid ""
"Set Group Access for the Network Group. Group access controls which Groups "
"at provision time will have access to this resource. Select \"all\" "
"(default) to give workloads provisioned to any Group access to this "
"resource. If this resource should be restricted only to workloads "
"provisioned to specific Groups, select all that apply."
msgstr ""
"Establecer Grupo Acceso para el Grupo de red. Grupo acceso controls cual "
"Grupos en provision tiempo será tienen acceso a este recurso. Seleccionar "
"\"todos\" (predeterminado) a dar cargas de trabajo aprovisionado a cualquier"
" Grupo acceso a este recurso. Si este recurso debería be restricted solo a "
"cargas de trabajo aprovisionado a específico Grupos, seleccionar todos ese "
"apply."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_groups.rst:22
msgid "Tenant Permissions"
msgstr "Tenant Permissions"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_groups.rst:22
msgid ""
"Resources with Public visibility will be available to users in any Tenant "
"(subject to other RBAC controls). Resources with Private visibility are "
"given only to individually selected Tenants. Select all that apply."
msgstr ""
"Recursos con Público visibility será be disponible a usuarios en cualquier "
"Inquilino (subject a otro RBAC controls). Recursos con Privado visibility "
"son given solo a individually seleccionado Inquilinos. Seleccionar todos ese"
" apply."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_groups.rst:24
msgid "Select :guilabel:`SAVE CHANGES`"
msgstr "Seleccionar :guilabel:`GUARDAR CAMBIOS`"
